Benefits

- No commission fees for guest or hotel.
- Automatic, instant refunds.
- Tamper-proof booking records
- No double bookings.
- Increased transparency through immutable transaction records.
- Removal of third-party payment intermediaries.
- Automated trust through smart contract execution.
- Improved auditability of booking transactions.


Challange

- Gas fees and limited scalability
- GDPR conflicts with permanent data.
- Guests need crypto wallets.
- Smart-contract bugs can be costly.
- Limited scalability of public blockchain networks.
- High gas costs during periods of network congestion.
- Requirement for users to understand cryptocurrency wallets.
